A '''repulsor trolley''' was a trolley that could move objects from one place to another. During the [[Aldhani heist]], a [[Aldhani rebel infiltration team|team]] of rebels forced Imperial troopers to move [[Galactic Credit Standard|credits]] on Repulsor trolleys.<ref name="The Eye">{{Andor|The Eye}}</ref>

{{Stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
In the new ''[[Star Wars]]'' [[canon]], Repulsor trolleys first appeared in "[[The Eye]]," the sixth episode of the [[Disney+]] series ''[[Star Wars: Andor]]'', which was directed by [[Susanna White]].<ref name="The Eye" /> [[Repulsor trolley/Legends|Repulsor trolley]]s originated in the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity, where it first appeared in the [[2008]] novel ''[[Legacy of the Force: Revelation]]''.<ref name="Revelation">''[[Legacy of the Force: Revelation]]''</ref>

